A1. One of those little black things often found in a watermelon. ~ PICKANINNY
A10. It took some horse power to raise this. ~ COLT
A14. The end of a Robin song. ~ ADAIR
A15. A stag party. ~ DEER
A16. Another fairy tale villain. ~ LIAR
A17. This caused quite a stir in Chicago. ~ WIND
A18. Every good dresser always has this. ~ GLASS
